<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Sagaso ze! Doragon Booru</i></font>

6
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:21,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Let's go seek them out! The Dragon Balls!</i></font>

7
00:00:21,080 --> 00:00:24,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Sekai de itto yukai na kiseki</i></font>

8
00:00:21,080 --> 00:00:24,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>One of the most delightful miracles in the world</i></font>

9
00:00:24,420 --> 00:00:27,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Kono yo wa dekkai takarajima</i></font>

10
00:00:24,420 --> 00:00:27,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>This life is one big treasure island</i></font>

11
00:00:27,890 --> 00:00:33,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>So sa ima koso adobencha!</i></font>

12
00:00:27,890 --> 00:00:33,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>It's the truth! Now more than ever, Adventure!</i></font>

13
00:00:35,490 --> 00:00:39,030
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Mune waku-waku no ai ga GISSIRI</i></font>

14
00:00:35,490 --> 00:00:39,030
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>The love of a pounding chest is GISSIRI</i></font>

15
00:00:39,030 --> 00:00:42,570
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Iro toridori no yume ga DOSSARI</i></font>

16
00:00:39,030 --> 00:00:42,570
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Multi-colored dreams rain down DOSSARI</i></font>

17
00:00:42,570 --> 00:00:49,540
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Kono yo no doko ka de hikatte 'ru</i></font>

18
00:00:42,570 --> 00:00:49,540
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Somewhere in this world, they are glowing</i></font>

19
00:00:49,540 --> 00:00:52,370
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Soitsu mitsuke ni yuko ze BOY</i></font>

20
00:00:49,540 --> 00:00:52,370
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Let's go on out there and find them, boy</i></font>

21
00:00:53,210 --> 00:00:56,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Yokai henge mo buttobashi</i></font>

22
00:00:53,210 --> 00:00:56,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>All the while pounding on mutants and monsters</i></font>

23
00:00:56,310 --> 00:01:02,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Kumo no mashin de kyo mo tobu no sa</i></font>

24
00:00:56,310 --> 00:01:02,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>And we'll fly through the day</i>
<i>on our cloud machine as well!</i></font>

25
00:01:03,720 --> 00:01:07,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Let's try, try, try makafushigi</i></font>

26
00:01:03,720 --> 00:01:07,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Let's try, try, try, how mysterious</i></font>

27
00:01:07,220 --> 00:01:09,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Sora o kakenuke yama o koe</i></font>

28
00:01:07,220 --> 00:01:09,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Charging through the sky,</i>
<i>while we overcome mountains!</i></font>

29
00:01:10,890 --> 00:01:13,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Let's fly, fly, fly, daiboken</i></font>

30
00:01:10,890 --> 00:01:13,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Let's fly, fly, fly, such an adventure</i></font>

31
00:01:14,470 --> 00:01:21,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Fushigi na tabi ga hajimaru ze</i></font>

32
00:01:14,470 --> 00:01:21,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Our strange little journey now begins!</i></font>

33
00:01:21,610 --> 00:01:25,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Te ni irero! Doragon Booru</i></font>

34
00:01:21,610 --> 00:01:25,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Let's get them in hand! The Dragon Balls!</i></font>

35
00:01:25,110 --> 00:01:28,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Sekai de itto tegowai chansu</i></font>

36
00:01:25,110 --> 00:01:28,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>One of the most formidable gambles in the world</i></font>

37
00:01:28,710 --> 00:01:31,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Oikakero! Doragon Booru</i></font>

38
00:01:28,710 --> 00:01:31,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Let's go chase them down! The Dragon Balls!</i></font>

39
00:01:32,120 --> 00:01:35,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Sekai de itto ikashita dorama</i></font>

40
00:01:32,120 --> 00:01:35,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Some of the most enjoyable drama in the world</i></font>

41
00:01:35,350 --> 00:01:38,820
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Kono yo wa dekkai takarajima</i></font>

42
00:01:35,350 --> 00:01:38,820
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>This life is one big treasure island</i></font>

43
00:01:38,820 --> 00:01:48,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>So sa ima koso adobencha!</i></font>

44
00:01:38,820 --> 00:01:48,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>It's the truth! Now more than ever, Adventure!</i></font>

45
00:02:12,930 --> 00:02:17,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Goku, who was able to</i>
<i>steal back the Dragon Balls,</i></font>

46
00:02:17,060 --> 00:02:23,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>speeds ever westward on Kinto Un</i>
<i>in search of the next ball.</i></font>

47
00:02:24,700 --> 00:02:29,570
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I sure hope the next Dragon Ball
is Grandpa's Four-Star Ball...</font>

48
00:02:36,880 --> 00:02:40,720
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">"The Sacred, Yet Ominous Land of Karin"</font>

49
00:02:43,470 --> 00:02:48,430
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Meanwhile, at the general headquarters</i>
<i>of the mighty Red Ribbon Army...</i></font>

50
00:03:12,460 --> 00:03:13,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Enter!</font>

51
00:03:13,830 --> 00:03:15,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Pardon my intrusion.</font>

52
00:03:15,200 --> 00:03:20,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Commander Red. Just as we thought,
the boy appears to be heading west.</font>

53
00:03:20,170 --> 00:03:23,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Towards Colonel Yellow, huh?</font>

54
00:03:23,110 --> 00:03:28,210
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's an outrage that Yellow <i>still</i>
hasn't located the Dragon Ball...!</font>

55
00:03:28,210 --> 00:03:32,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yes. It appears he's having more
difficulty than we anticipated.</font>

56
00:03:32,320 --> 00:03:37,380
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Everyone's so incompetent.
I just want to end this game quickly...</font>

57
00:04:38,830 --> 00:04:42,800
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Are you trying to make yourself
an enemy of the Red Ribbon Army?!</font>

58
00:04:42,800 --> 00:04:45,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Just do as I say and hand over the ball!</font>

59
00:04:45,240 --> 00:04:49,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I do not care about the ball. But I <i>am</i>
the protector of this sacred land!</font>

60
00:04:49,320 --> 00:04:51,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I will not allow you to
ravage these sacred grounds!</font>

61
00:04:51,880 --> 00:04:55,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Sacred land? Don't make me laugh!</font>

62
00:04:55,990 --> 00:04:59,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Be gone or die!</font>

63
00:05:02,460 --> 00:05:04,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Father! Behind you!</font>

64
00:05:18,910 --> 00:05:20,460
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Dammit...!</font>

65
00:05:20,460 --> 00:05:22,930
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Shoot! Blast him to pieces!</font>

66
00:05:29,660 --> 00:05:33,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I told you, guns are useless!</font>

67
00:06:03,660 --> 00:06:05,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Has he left?</font>

68
00:06:08,910 --> 00:06:11,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Father!</font>

69
00:06:11,410 --> 00:06:14,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I will go bury these men. Wait here.</font>

70
00:06:14,280 --> 00:06:15,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Okay!</font>

71
00:06:25,090 --> 00:06:30,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">T-This is Colonel Yellow!
Headquarters, please respond!</font>

72
00:06:30,140 --> 00:06:34,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Adviser Black! Colonel
Yellow has contacted us!</font>

73
00:06:34,780 --> 00:06:36,920
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What is it?</font>

74
00:06:36,920 --> 00:06:39,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What?! Everyone was
wiped out except for you?!</font>

75
00:06:39,660 --> 00:06:41,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So what about the Dragon Ball?!</font>

76
00:06:41,630 --> 00:06:45,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It appears to have
fallen into enemy hands!</font>

77
00:06:45,060 --> 00:06:47,360
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Get it at all costs!</font>

78
00:06:47,360 --> 00:06:50,960
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're as good as dead if
you mess this up any further!</font>

79
00:06:50,970 --> 00:06:55,100
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I know! But I'm not
out of options just yet!</font>

80
00:06:55,110 --> 00:06:59,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">How can you call yourselves members
of the almighty Red Ribbon Army?!</font>

81
00:06:59,240 --> 00:07:03,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">--Commander Red...!
--Give me that! Listen up, Yellow!</font>

82
00:07:03,170 --> 00:07:05,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Y-Yes, Commander Red!</font>

83
00:07:05,950 --> 00:07:08,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You have one hour.</font>

84
00:07:08,650 --> 00:07:13,920
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">If you don't steal the Dragon Ball
by then, I will send Tao Pai Pai there!</font>

85
00:07:13,920 --> 00:07:15,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Tao Pai Pai?!</font>

86
00:07:15,530 --> 00:07:17,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Tao Pai Pai, the assassin...?!</font>

87
00:07:17,860 --> 00:07:19,560
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I don't think such drastic
measures are necessary...!</font>

88
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:24,430
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Quiet! I'm going to take care of the boy
and the rest all in one fell swoop!</font>

89
00:07:24,440 --> 00:07:28,930
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Naturally, if you fail, I'll be
sending Tao Pai Pai after you, too!</font>

90
00:07:28,940 --> 00:07:30,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Y-Yes, sir!</font>

91
00:07:30,670 --> 00:07:36,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">H-He has a kid! I'll use him
as a hostage to get the ball!</font>

92
00:07:39,970 --> 00:07:43,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I have to hurry and get
strong just like Father!</font>

93
00:08:04,660 --> 00:08:07,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Father!</font>

94
00:08:07,330 --> 00:08:09,760
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, no! Upa!</font>

95
00:08:09,760 --> 00:08:12,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now then, where'd he go?</font>

96
00:08:12,880 --> 00:08:15,210
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What are you doing with my son?!</font>

97
00:08:15,220 --> 00:08:17,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There ya are!</font>

98
00:08:17,220 --> 00:08:20,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Father...!</font>

99
00:08:20,090 --> 00:08:24,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Listen up! If you don't want the kid
to die, you'll hand over the ball!</font>

100
00:08:24,660 --> 00:08:28,190
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Throw the ball up here! Got it?!</font>

101
00:08:28,200 --> 00:08:30,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">How dishonorable!</font>

102
00:08:30,700 --> 00:08:33,970
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It sounds like it will work
out this time, doesn't it?</font>

103
00:08:33,970 --> 00:08:38,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Even if we do steal it, the real problem
is with the brat called Son Goku.</font>

104
00:08:38,310 --> 00:08:41,970
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Commander! Son Goku is
approaching Colonel Yellow's position</font>

105
00:08:41,980 --> 00:08:43,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">at tremendous speed!</font>

106
00:08:46,700 --> 00:08:51,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Curses! What speed! He's there already?!</font>

107
00:08:51,670 --> 00:08:55,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The ball is right here!
Come down, I will give it to you!</font>

108
00:08:55,070 --> 00:08:58,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yeah, right! You'll kill me if I land!</font>

109
00:08:58,040 --> 00:09:00,640
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Throw it up here!</font>

110
00:09:00,650 --> 00:09:04,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Unlike you men, I am not so cowardly!</font>

111
00:09:08,050 --> 00:09:09,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Okay! Right around here!</font>

112
00:09:09,790 --> 00:09:14,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Help! Father!</font>

113
00:09:14,890 --> 00:09:16,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What was that?</font>

114
00:09:20,910 --> 00:09:23,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Throw it up here already!</font>

115
00:09:26,880 --> 00:09:29,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I've seen your type of
plane somewhere before...</font>

116
00:09:29,950 --> 00:09:32,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What's that?</font>

117
00:09:32,320 --> 00:09:36,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I got it! You're with the Red Ribbon Army!</font>

118
00:09:36,220 --> 00:09:38,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">C-Could this kid be the one who's...?!</font>

119
00:09:43,460 --> 00:09:45,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Upa!</font>

120
00:09:47,870 --> 00:09:49,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Got you!</font>

121
00:10:01,050 --> 00:10:02,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hiya!</font>

122
00:10:05,050 --> 00:10:07,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">We've lost contact!</font>

123
00:10:07,320 --> 00:10:10,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Get Tao Pai Pai!</font>

124
00:10:13,750 --> 00:10:16,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I thank you for rescuing my son.</font>

125
00:10:16,620 --> 00:10:20,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">All I did was rescue him while
beating up that Red Ribbon Army guy.</font>

126
00:10:20,560 --> 00:10:22,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Thanks, Brother!</font>

127
00:10:27,100 --> 00:10:30,760
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's it! You're holding
the Dragon Ball, Mister!</font>

128
00:10:30,770 --> 00:10:34,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Let me see it!</font>

129
00:10:34,640 --> 00:10:37,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You also desire this ball?</font>

130
00:10:37,740 --> 00:10:44,640
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">One... two... three... four...!</font>

131
00:10:44,650 --> 00:10:47,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I did it! It's the Four-Star Ball!</font>

132
00:10:47,320 --> 00:10:50,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I found Grandpa's Four-Star Ball!</font>

133
00:10:50,890 --> 00:10:52,720
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">--What exactly is this all about?
--Hurray!</font>

134
00:10:52,720 --> 00:10:55,750
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">--What exactly is that ball?
--Hurray!</font>

135
00:11:08,790 --> 00:11:12,360
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey, you! Do you have any
idea what this place is?!</font>

136
00:11:12,360 --> 00:11:15,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Get lost! Unless you feel like dyin'!</font>

137
00:11:26,370 --> 00:11:30,570
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Forgetting the face of your superior
officer is as low as you can get!</font>

138
00:11:33,780 --> 00:11:36,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">G-General Blue!</font>

139
00:11:36,920 --> 00:11:39,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hurry and open the gate!</font>

140
00:11:57,540 --> 00:12:02,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The world's greatest assassin,
Tao Pai Pai, at your service!</font>

141
00:12:25,260 --> 00:12:29,540
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Thank you for coming, Tao Pai Pai.
Forgive my abruptness, but--</font>

142
00:12:29,540 --> 00:12:35,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'll mention this beforehand,
but my fee is extraordinarily high.</font>

143
00:12:35,880 --> 00:12:40,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">As long as you do your job successfully,
I'll pay you anything you want.</font>

144
00:12:40,820 --> 00:12:44,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I charge 100 million zeni for each
person I put out of commission.</font>

145
00:12:44,890 --> 00:12:48,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">100 million zeni...?!</font>

146
00:12:48,110 --> 00:12:50,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">However, you are very lucky.</font>

147
00:12:50,950 --> 00:12:55,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This year marks my 20th
year as an assassin,</font>

148
00:12:55,290 --> 00:12:57,820
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">so I'm having a 50 percent-off sale.</font>

149
00:12:57,820 --> 00:13:02,790
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I will mark down the price to
50 million zeni per victim.</font>

150
00:13:02,800 --> 00:13:05,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">T-Thanks...</font>

151
00:13:05,400 --> 00:13:10,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Are you really Tao Pai Pai-<i>san</i>...?</font>

152
00:13:10,940 --> 00:13:13,470
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Would you like to find out for yourself?</font>

153
00:13:13,470 --> 00:13:15,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No, that's fine...!</font>

154
00:13:15,840 --> 00:13:19,850
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">--W-Who is it?!
--Blue.</font>

155
00:13:19,850 --> 00:13:21,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Blue?</font>

156
00:13:21,650 --> 00:13:23,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Enter!</font>

157
00:13:27,850 --> 00:13:30,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I have just returned.</font>

158
00:13:30,490 --> 00:13:32,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">How were you able to come back?</font>

159
00:13:32,890 --> 00:13:36,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I had a very difficult time.
Stealing planes, stealing cars--</font>

160
00:13:36,490 --> 00:13:40,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That is not what I meant!</font>

161
00:13:40,130 --> 00:13:43,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What I mean is, how were you
able to come crawling back here</font>

162
00:13:43,170 --> 00:13:47,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">after having the Dragon Balls
stolen by Son Goku or whoever?!</font>

163
00:13:47,130 --> 00:13:49,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">B-But there was nothing
I could do, I was--</font>

164
00:13:49,630 --> 00:13:53,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I don't feel like hearing your excuses!</font>

165
00:13:53,130 --> 00:13:57,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I did steal the enemy's radar, though!</font>

166
00:13:58,770 --> 00:14:02,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Here it is! You can zoom
in and out freely with it</font>

167
00:14:02,840 --> 00:14:07,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">to pinpoint the location
of the Dragon Balls!</font>

168
00:14:07,150 --> 00:14:09,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's really this small?</font>

169
00:14:09,350 --> 00:14:13,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'll use this to collect all
seven Dragon Balls for you!</font>

170
00:14:13,650 --> 00:14:15,920
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I see.</font>

171
00:14:17,690 --> 00:14:19,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That was quite an
outstanding achievement.</font>

172
00:14:19,990 --> 00:14:26,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But my orders were to bring
the Dragon Balls to me!</font>

173
00:14:26,170 --> 00:14:29,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Those who fail to
perform their duties...</font>

174
00:14:29,840 --> 00:14:31,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...are to be executed!</font>

175
00:14:31,710 --> 00:14:34,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You can't be serious!</font>

176
00:14:44,280 --> 00:14:48,190
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">However, you have worked especially
hard for the Red Ribbon Army.</font>

177
00:14:48,190 --> 00:14:51,560
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I will give you a chance!</font>

178
00:14:51,560 --> 00:14:58,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'll forgive you if you can defeat
Tao Pai Pai here in a fight.</font>

179
00:14:58,050 --> 00:15:01,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Thank you, Commander!</font>

180
00:15:15,630 --> 00:15:19,640
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So you're Tao Pai Pai,
the world's best assassin?</font>

181
00:15:19,640 --> 00:15:22,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Want my autograph?</font>

182
00:15:23,740 --> 00:15:29,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">If you're the best assassin in the world,
then I'm the best in the universe.</font>

183
00:15:29,320 --> 00:15:34,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I will have to charge you for taking
care of him, too. Is this acceptable?</font>

184
00:15:34,150 --> 00:15:37,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's fine. Let me see your skills.</font>

185
00:15:37,320 --> 00:15:40,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">If you'd like to use a weapon,
go right ahead.</font>

186
00:15:42,180 --> 00:15:44,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I won't need to use my hands or legs,</font>

187
00:15:44,610 --> 00:15:47,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I will defeat you with my tongue alone.</font>

188
00:15:47,880 --> 00:15:50,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Sounds like fun.</font>

189
00:15:52,000 --> 00:15:53,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Begin!</font>

190
00:16:22,280 --> 00:16:26,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That didn't take long to beat him.</font>

191
00:16:26,050 --> 00:16:30,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">H-He killed Blue... in a single instant...!</font>

192
00:16:30,590 --> 00:16:33,960
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">U-Unbelievable...! He's incredible...!</font>

193
00:16:33,960 --> 00:16:37,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Just what I would expect
from the infamous Tao Pai Pai!</font>

194
00:16:37,730 --> 00:16:41,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now then, I assume playtime is over?</font>

195
00:16:41,600 --> 00:16:45,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Tell me who my real targets are.</font>

196
00:16:57,060 --> 00:16:59,560
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What? A little boy?</font>

197
00:16:59,560 --> 00:17:02,370
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're gravely mistaken if
you think he's an ordinary kid.</font>

198
00:17:02,370 --> 00:17:05,370
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">His strength is extraordinary.</font>

199
00:17:05,370 --> 00:17:09,210
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Well, as long as I receive
the money owed to me,</font>

200
00:17:09,210 --> 00:17:12,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I will exterminate anyone you wish.</font>

201
00:17:12,080 --> 00:17:14,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm pleased to hear it!</font>

202
00:17:14,040 --> 00:17:20,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Also, that Son Goku kid
should have four balls with him.</font>

203
00:17:20,580 --> 00:17:24,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Steal them and bring them to me.
I'm counting on you.</font>

204
00:17:24,490 --> 00:17:26,960
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">They're like this.</font>

205
00:17:33,260 --> 00:17:36,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">--It'll cost extra.
--That's fine!</font>

206
00:17:36,300 --> 00:17:42,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Also, if any other people get in the way,
kill as many of them as you like!</font>

207
00:17:42,940 --> 00:17:47,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Understood. I shall send
you a thorough invoice.</font>

208
00:17:49,410 --> 00:17:54,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The location is Karin, 2,300 kilometers
northeast of here, correct?</font>

209
00:17:54,020 --> 00:17:56,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">We've prepared a jet for you.
Please come this way.</font>

210
00:17:56,990 --> 00:17:59,460
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That will not do.</font>

211
00:17:59,460 --> 00:18:02,760
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It would take too much
time in an airplane.</font>

212
00:18:12,470 --> 00:18:15,640
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">May I borrow one of these pillars?</font>

213
00:18:15,640 --> 00:18:19,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">A pillar?! W-What for?</font>

214
00:18:31,860 --> 00:18:35,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">2,300 kilometers northeast...</font>

215
00:18:35,830 --> 00:18:39,190
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I shall return in 30 minutes.</font>

216
00:18:54,260 --> 00:18:57,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">H-He is truly mind-boggling...!</font>

217
00:18:58,630 --> 00:19:02,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now the Dragon Balls
are as good as mine!</font>

218
00:19:16,380 --> 00:19:20,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Those balls possess such a secret?</font>

219
00:19:20,050 --> 00:19:24,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So that is the reason why
they tried so hard to steal it.</font>

220
00:19:24,060 --> 00:19:27,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But I don't really have
anything to wish for,</font>

221
00:19:27,900 --> 00:19:32,800
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">so I'm happy just having
my grandpa's Four-Star Ball!</font>

222
00:19:34,680 --> 00:19:41,680
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">By the way, what's
that <i>really</i> tall thingy?</font>

223
00:19:41,680 --> 00:19:43,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This?</font>

224
00:19:43,990 --> 00:19:50,230
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This sacred tower that soars into
the heavens is known as Karin Tower.</font>

225
00:19:50,230 --> 00:19:52,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Karin Tower?</font>

226
00:20:12,860 --> 00:20:18,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It is said that a hermit
lives at the very top.</font>

227
00:20:19,830 --> 00:20:27,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">If you can climb all the way up
using only your own strength</font>

228
00:20:27,770 --> 00:20:33,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">and then drink the holy water
that the hermit gives you,</font>

229
00:20:33,510 --> 00:20:38,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">your strength will be
increased by many times.</font>

230
00:20:51,360 --> 00:20:55,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Amazing! Your strength will
be increased by many times?</font>

231
00:20:55,700 --> 00:20:58,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Have you climbed it, Mister?</font>

232
00:20:58,200 --> 00:21:04,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I tried once when I was
still young, but I failed.</font>

233
00:21:04,040 --> 00:21:07,210
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No one has ever seen the top yet.</font>

234
00:21:07,210 --> 00:21:11,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I heard that one person
did a really long time ago!</font>

235
00:21:11,050 --> 00:21:15,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That is an old tale.
No one knows if it is true or not.</font>

236
00:21:15,090 --> 00:21:19,560
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Really? It sure is tall, though!</font>

237
00:21:19,560 --> 00:21:22,230
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So what do you two do here?</font>

238
00:21:22,230 --> 00:21:29,230
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">My people have protected this
sacred tower for generations.</font>

239
00:21:29,240 --> 00:21:34,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">We do not allow anyone to ravage
this land, no matter who they might be.</font>

240
00:21:34,070 --> 00:21:36,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I see...</font>

241
00:21:36,710 --> 00:21:41,370
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I wonder if taking <i>Kinto Un</i>
to the top would work or not...</font>

242
00:21:49,440 --> 00:21:51,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>I take it that's the place.</i></font>

243
00:21:52,660 --> 00:21:58,460
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Amazing! Your power gets
increased by many times?</font>

244
00:21:59,960 --> 00:22:05,570
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That is what the old tales say,
but it may only be a superstition.</font>

245
00:22:05,570 --> 00:22:08,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Maybe I should try climbing it, too...</font>

246
00:22:09,950 --> 00:22:12,480
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What's that, Father?</font>

247
00:22:12,480 --> 00:22:14,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Something's flying this way!</font>

248
00:22:14,140 --> 00:22:17,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There's someone riding on it!</font>

249
00:22:25,780 --> 00:22:28,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">--It's coming this way!
--Look out!</font>

250
00:22:43,300 --> 00:22:45,430
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Aloha!</font>

251
00:22:48,140 --> 00:22:51,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Who are you?!</font>

252
00:22:51,710 --> 00:22:55,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Tao Pai Pai,
the world's greatest assassin.</font>

253
00:22:55,310 --> 00:22:57,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Assassin?</font>

254
00:22:57,610 --> 00:23:01,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What purpose does an assassin have
here in the sacred land of Karin?!</font>

255
00:23:01,150 --> 00:23:03,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I have no business with this place.</font>

256
00:23:03,320 --> 00:23:05,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What I <i>do</i> have business
with is that boy over there.</font>

257
00:23:05,660 --> 00:23:09,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">--What?!
--What do you want from me?</font>

258
00:23:09,060 --> 00:23:12,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I don't even know you!</font>

259
00:23:12,160 --> 00:23:16,370
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Perhaps if I told you the Red Ribbon Army
sent me, that would answer your question.</font>

260
00:23:16,370 --> 00:23:18,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Red Ribbon?!</font>

261
00:23:18,300 --> 00:23:22,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">My job is to kill you because you are
an obstacle in their ball-collecting.</font>

262
00:23:22,710 --> 00:23:27,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Again?! You guys never give up!</font>

263
00:23:27,180 --> 00:23:31,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Father! Help him!</font>

264
00:23:31,320 --> 00:23:36,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That young boy saved my son's life.</font>

265
00:23:36,350 --> 00:23:40,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">If you do not leave quietly now,
you will have to face me!</font>

266
00:23:41,410 --> 00:23:44,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's okay, Mister! I'll fight him!</font>

267
00:23:44,620 --> 00:23:48,750
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It is my duty to protect
this sacred land of Karin.</font>

268
00:23:48,750 --> 00:23:53,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">--Stand back, Upa!
--Okay!</font>

269
00:23:53,420 --> 00:23:57,920
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What a fool. To think that you would
go out of your way to choose death...</font>

270
00:24:00,270 --> 00:24:02,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Come at me!</font>

271
00:24:02,020 --> 00:24:04,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Father! Try hard!</font>

272
00:24:06,440 --> 00:24:09,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It seems you think
you're well trained.</font>

273
00:24:09,610 --> 00:24:15,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">In that case, I will hold
nothing back and come at you!</font>

274
00:24:15,320 --> 00:24:16,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He's fast!</font>

275
00:24:18,900 --> 00:24:22,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What is this?
What's wrong? It's not moving!</font>

276
00:24:25,480 --> 00:24:28,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What about now? Look.</font>

277
00:24:32,780 --> 00:24:33,970
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No good?</font>

278
00:24:33,970 --> 00:24:36,370
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Then I'll move it for you!</font>

279
00:24:42,980 --> 00:24:46,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You can have your spear back.</font>

280
00:24:46,420 --> 00:24:48,380
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">--<i>Kinto Un</i>!
--Father!</font>

281
00:25:07,870 --> 00:25:14,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Father! Father!</font>

282
00:25:14,710 --> 00:25:17,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Father!</font>

283
00:25:19,250 --> 00:25:24,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now then, time for the main event.</font>

284
00:25:24,420 --> 00:25:27,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You bastard!</font>

285
00:25:36,800 --> 00:25:44,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Will Goku be able to stand up</i>
<i>to this cruel and vile assassin?</i></font>

286
00:26:12,340 --> 00:26:15,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Oide fantaji</i></font>

287
00:26:12,340 --> 00:26:15,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Come along, fantasy</i></font>

288
00:26:15,240 --> 00:26:17,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Suki sa misuteri</i></font>

289
00:26:15,240 --> 00:26:17,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>I enjoy a mystery</i></font>

290
00:26:17,840 --> 00:26:24,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Kimi no wakasa kakusanai de</i></font>

291
00:26:17,840 --> 00:26:24,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Don't you go hiding your youth!</i></font>

292
00:26:24,420 --> 00:26:27,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Fushigi shitakute</i></font>

293
00:26:24,420 --> 00:26:27,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Wanting to perform the mysterious</i></font>

294
00:26:27,420 --> 00:26:29,920
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Boken shitakute</i></font>

295
00:26:27,420 --> 00:26:29,920
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Wanting to pursue the adventure</i></font>

296
00:26:29,920 --> 00:26:35,930
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Dare mo min'na uzu-uzu shite 'ru</i></font>

297
00:26:29,920 --> 00:26:35,930
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Everyone is itching to go!</i></font>

298
00:26:35,930 --> 00:26:41,930
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Otona no furi shite akiramecha</i></font>

299
00:26:35,930 --> 00:26:41,930
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>If you act like an adult and give up</i></font>

300
00:26:41,930 --> 00:26:48,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Kiseki no nazo nado tokenai yo</i></font>

301
00:26:41,930 --> 00:26:48,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>You'll never unravel the mystery of the miracle!</i></font>

302
00:26:48,110 --> 00:26:59,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Motto wairudo ni motto takumashiku ikite goran</i></font>

303
00:26:48,110 --> 00:26:59,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Go on and try to live</i>
<i>even more wild and strong!</i></font>

304
00:26:59,220 --> 00:27:06,790
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Romantikku ageru yo, romantikku ageru yo</i></font>

305
00:26:59,220 --> 00:27:06,790
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>I'll give you a romance,</i>
<i>I'll give you a romance</i></font>

306
00:27:06,790 --> 00:27:11,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Honto no yuki misete kuretara</i></font>

307
00:27:06,790 --> 00:27:11,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>If you will show me your true courage</i></font>

308
00:27:11,300 --> 00:27:18,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Romantikku ageru yo, romantikku ageru yo</i></font>

309
00:27:11,300 --> 00:27:18,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>I'll give you a romance,</i>
<i>I'll give you a romance</i></font>

310
00:27:18,670 --> 00:27:27,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Tokimeku mune ni</i>
<i>kira-kira hikatta yume o ageru yo</i></font>

311
00:27:18,670 --> 00:27:27,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>I'll give your pounding heart</i>
<i>a glittery, shining dream!</i></font>

